    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Office 29</i> is a first-person anomaly horror game set in an eerie office building. After falling asleep at your desk, you awaken at night to find the entire building empty. Strange occurrences begin to unfold, and you must collect 29 personal belongings scattered throughout the office while avoiding mysterious anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Anomalies</strong>: Encounter strange and unsettling events, from floating figures to objects behaving unnaturally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Exploration</strong>: Solve environmental puzzles as you navigate the empty office and uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Immerse yourself in a tense and unsettling atmosphere as you try to escape the building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Collectibles</strong>: Discover the story of Office 29 through the 29 collectible items scattered across the building.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out, or will the office claim you as its next anomaly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Time</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use W-A-S-D to move around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse to look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse click to interact with certain objects</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Office 29</i> is a first-person anomaly horror game set in an eerie office building. After falling asleep at your desk, you awaken at night to find the entire building empty. Strange occurrences begin to unfold, and you must collect 29 personal belongings scattered throughout the office while avoiding mysterious anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Anomalies</strong>: Encounter strange and unsettling events, from floating figures to objects behaving unnaturally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Exploration</strong>: Solve environmental puzzles as you navigate the empty office and uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Immerse yourself in a tense and unsettling atmosphere as you try to escape the building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Collectibles</strong>: Discover the story of Office 29 through the 29 collectible items scattered across the building.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out, or will the office claim you as its next anomaly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Time</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use W-A-S-D to move around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse to look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse click to interact with certain objects</p></li></ul>",
